WEBVTT

01:25.280 --> 01:30.960
ADAPTED FROM A SHUQI.COM NOVEL
ORIGINAL AUTHOR: SENLIN LU

01:34.000 --> 01:34.840
CULTIVATION AND CAUTION

01:34.920 --> 01:35.840
Peiyi.

01:37.600 --> 01:39.360
Just know how I feel,

01:39.440 --> 01:41.360
but don't let it weigh on you.

01:43.320 --> 01:44.280
And I

01:45.080 --> 01:48.320
won't look back on the choice I've made.

01:59.720 --> 02:00.680
What is that?

02:01.520 --> 02:03.920
Airglow. It's extremely rare.

02:04.440 --> 02:05.280
I checked the almanac.

02:06.720 --> 02:08.120
A crimson light stretches

02:08.840 --> 02:10.280
from the Hua constellation to the Ji.

02:15.400 --> 02:17.120
It was the celestial sign
on the day of your birth.

02:19.760 --> 02:20.720
Thank you.

02:21.520 --> 02:23.640
You answered every question I had.

02:44.440 --> 02:45.800
CHAI'S BLACKSMITH

02:45.880 --> 02:47.040
You picked a good spot.

02:47.120 --> 02:49.680
Even if someone tries to eavesdrop,
they can't hear much.

02:50.400 --> 02:51.960
The blacksmith is a reliable man.

02:52.040 --> 02:53.760
Your Ladyship can rest assured.

02:56.880 --> 02:58.000
I've checked

02:58.080 --> 03:00.240
every clinic and pharmacy on the street

03:00.320 --> 03:02.040
and in the Ghost Market.

03:02.120 --> 03:04.840
Indeed, someone is looking
for eye medicine.

03:05.360 --> 03:06.240
PRESCRIPTION

03:06.320 --> 03:08.960
Apiaceae root and licorice
neutralize toxins.

03:09.480 --> 03:12.240
Honeysuckle and cassia seeds
improve eyesight.

03:13.000 --> 03:14.440
All these various prescriptions

03:14.520 --> 03:16.280
contain four crucial ingredients.

03:18.680 --> 03:20.880
I'd say these patient names

03:21.480 --> 03:23.960
are either fabricated
or planted there as a cover-up.

03:24.040 --> 03:26.880
You're right. I looked into them.

03:26.960 --> 03:29.400
These people do exist.

03:29.480 --> 03:31.520
But they never used those medicines.

03:31.600 --> 03:34.760
But as for who actually used the medicine,

03:34.840 --> 03:36.800
that trail has truly gone cold.

03:39.280 --> 03:40.200
That's expected.

03:41.160 --> 03:44.080
His eye is stained with the toxic blood
spat out by the old man.

03:44.600 --> 03:45.960
He's having a hard time.

03:47.800 --> 03:50.080
An eye injury is quite special.

03:50.160 --> 03:51.760
It's too obvious.

03:52.360 --> 03:54.360
No wonder he is so low-key and cautious.

03:55.080 --> 03:56.600
He's been poisoned for over a month.

03:57.840 --> 03:59.680
The old man's poison

04:00.240 --> 04:02.160
will make him suffer.

04:02.240 --> 04:05.040
It won't kill him,
but it'll leave him in misery.

04:05.800 --> 04:07.360
What poison did Inspector Du use?

04:08.400 --> 04:09.560
He had too many types of poison.

04:09.640 --> 04:10.600
I'm not sure.

04:11.200 --> 04:13.720
We can only try to deduce
based on the prescriptions.

04:16.160 --> 04:18.600
The old man
probably recognized that person.

04:19.279 --> 04:20.600
Really?

04:20.680 --> 04:22.160
Did he leave any clues?

04:23.480 --> 04:25.520
He exchanged a few moves with him.

04:25.600 --> 04:27.200
Judging from his reaction,

04:27.280 --> 04:28.800
he was no stranger to that man.

04:28.880 --> 04:31.840
That man realized it and killed him.

04:31.920 --> 04:33.360
Perhaps,

04:35.000 --> 04:36.400
he also works for the court.

04:36.480 --> 04:38.280
Maybe of high status, too.

04:40.360 --> 04:43.200
If he really works for the court,
it's easy to find him.

04:43.720 --> 04:45.040
Check them one by one.

04:45.120 --> 04:48.360
We will surely find
that one-eyed man, or his corpse.

04:49.560 --> 04:51.720
They had the nerve to kill Inspector Du.

04:51.800 --> 04:54.280
Your Ladyship, be careful.

04:55.800 --> 04:57.440
It's not that easy to kill me.

04:57.520 --> 04:58.920
But you…

04:59.000 --> 05:00.480
You must stay safe.

05:02.200 --> 05:03.560
What should we do next?

05:03.640 --> 05:05.960
PRESCRIPTION

05:08.080 --> 05:10.240
Is this meant to cure the eyes
or to detoxify?

05:11.400 --> 05:14.160
When it comes to eye treatment,

05:14.240 --> 05:15.640
Physician Liu is the best.

05:15.720 --> 05:17.120
But regarding detoxification,

05:17.200 --> 05:18.720
I'm the one you need.

05:19.840 --> 05:21.640
Keep an eye out for someone
with a poisoned left eye.

05:22.480 --> 05:24.600
- A court official?
- That's right.

05:25.720 --> 05:26.760
This is strange.

05:26.840 --> 05:29.000
Why wouldn't a court official
come to me for that?

05:30.560 --> 05:31.880
This person is cautious.

05:31.960 --> 05:33.320
I don't think he's come here.

05:34.000 --> 05:35.200
It's been more than a month.

05:35.280 --> 05:38.360
He's been seeking medicine
under someone else's identity

05:38.440 --> 05:39.280
but to no avail.

05:39.360 --> 05:42.760
Even if he seeks your help,
he won't come in person.

05:42.840 --> 05:44.680
Nor will he mention
anything about his eyes.

05:46.160 --> 05:47.920
- A perpetrator?
- An enemy.

05:50.880 --> 05:53.160
What kind of poison are we talking about?

05:54.640 --> 05:56.920
I'm not sure. But it develops quickly,

05:57.000 --> 05:58.520
causing numbness in the limbs,

05:58.600 --> 06:00.320
difficulty breathing, and vomiting blood.

06:02.520 --> 06:04.520
The Apiaceae root and licorice are meant

06:04.600 --> 06:06.720
to neutralize the poisonous star anise.

06:06.800 --> 06:09.160
The vomiting of blood
is likely caused by other toxins.

06:09.240 --> 06:11.480
Give me some time. I'll figure it out.

06:12.360 --> 06:13.280
Thanks in advance.

06:21.840 --> 06:24.120
I thought my wooden figure
was one of a kind.

06:24.200 --> 06:25.200
You made so many.

06:25.280 --> 06:26.440
Trying to please someone else?

06:27.640 --> 06:28.720
These ordinary figures

06:28.800 --> 06:30.840
are not comparable
to the customized one for you.

06:35.400 --> 06:36.640
They do look rougher.

06:37.240 --> 06:39.800
If you know what I'm doing,
you wouldn't blame me.

06:42.200 --> 06:44.600
We have some new female apprentices.

06:44.680 --> 06:46.880
Physician Liu said
that I made great figures and told me

06:46.960 --> 06:48.000
to tutor the apprentices.

06:48.080 --> 06:50.440
These wooden figures
are tools for teaching.

06:51.880 --> 06:53.520
Congratulations on becoming a mentor.

06:56.160 --> 06:58.960
ASTRONOMICAL BUREAU

07:24.160 --> 07:25.400
You followed me all the way.

07:25.480 --> 07:26.920
What can I do for you?

07:29.120 --> 07:30.160
Come with me.

07:30.800 --> 07:31.920
May I ask who you are?

07:32.600 --> 07:33.920
You're about to die.

07:34.000 --> 07:35.840
Why bother asking?

07:37.320 --> 07:40.360
Naturally, I need to know my killer

07:40.440 --> 07:43.160
to seek justice in the afterworld.

07:45.040 --> 07:46.920
The mortal world has no justice.

07:47.000 --> 07:48.760
Why would the afterworld be any different?

07:51.240 --> 07:52.920
I know you don't know martial arts.

07:53.600 --> 07:56.120
Come with me. Don't try anything smart.

07:58.080 --> 07:59.720
It's not that easy to take me with you.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.520
- I have reinforcements.
- Mr. Xiao.

08:08.360 --> 08:09.320
She's not as fast as I am.

08:10.120 --> 08:11.240
You can't be faster than this.

08:36.400 --> 08:37.360
Peiyi.

08:39.200 --> 08:40.240
Are you alright?

08:42.080 --> 08:44.400
- I'm hurt.
- Where?

08:48.640 --> 08:51.160
- He hasn't gone far yet.
- It's pouring.

08:51.240 --> 08:52.080
Don't go after him.

08:52.160 --> 08:53.400
But he tried to kill you.

08:53.480 --> 08:54.960
He wasn't trying to kill me.

08:56.600 --> 08:57.960
He was forcing me to leave with him.

08:58.040 --> 09:00.280
I'm sure he'll come back.

09:00.360 --> 09:01.720
We can catch him next time.

09:03.120 --> 09:04.720
It's getting chilly. Don't catch a cold.

09:07.200 --> 09:09.000
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

09:09.080 --> 09:10.480
What does that man look like?

09:11.080 --> 09:13.360
He is of medium build
and wears a bamboo hat

09:13.440 --> 09:14.560
to conceal his face.

09:14.640 --> 09:16.840
I saw his eyes.

09:16.920 --> 09:18.920
Thick eyebrows and small eyes
with a scar at the corner.

09:19.000 --> 09:22.440
His fingers are black, rough, and chapped,

09:22.520 --> 09:23.440
with protruding joints.

09:23.520 --> 09:25.200
But I don't think he's a hitman.

09:25.280 --> 09:27.320
Those are the hands of a heavy laborer.

09:28.000 --> 09:30.520
His blade is basic,
not made of good steel.

09:30.600 --> 09:31.640
There is rust on the handle.

09:31.720 --> 09:32.960
He doesn't use it often.

09:33.040 --> 09:34.240
But it's possible

09:34.320 --> 09:37.120
that he found an old blade
to cover up his identity.

09:38.000 --> 09:38.840
Mr. Xiao.

09:38.920 --> 09:40.400
Have you offended anyone recently?

09:40.480 --> 09:42.720
I am on good terms with my colleagues.

09:42.800 --> 09:44.400
No conflicting patterns in the stars.

09:44.920 --> 09:47.040
Even if I've unknowingly offended someone,

09:47.120 --> 09:49.800
it shouldn't be enough
to make them want me dead.

09:51.120 --> 09:53.600
Could he be Silver Mask's subordinate?

09:54.400 --> 09:56.560
He knows martial arts,
but he's only average,

09:56.640 --> 09:57.960
definitely no match for Your Ladyship.

09:58.040 --> 09:59.880
Silver Mask's subordinates

09:59.960 --> 10:02.000
were ruthless, nothing like him.

10:03.720 --> 10:06.200
Even though I'm better than him,

10:06.280 --> 10:07.560
I could tell

10:07.640 --> 10:10.440
that he wasn't going all out
during the fight.

10:10.520 --> 10:12.480
He just kept blocking, trying to get away.

10:14.760 --> 10:17.880
Who in the world
would come after Mr. Xiao?

10:23.000 --> 10:24.520
We need more clues.

10:24.600 --> 10:27.320
That man didn't even confirm my identity.

10:27.400 --> 10:28.360
He wasn't necessarily after me.

10:29.160 --> 10:31.040
Let's not jump to conclusions.

10:35.080 --> 10:36.120
Perhaps,

10:36.200 --> 10:39.000
he saw Your Ladyship
and realized that he was mistaken.

10:39.080 --> 10:40.160
Then we don't have to worry.

10:40.960 --> 10:42.960
He lay in ambush
outside the Astronomical Bureau

10:43.040 --> 10:44.520
to get Mr. Xiao for sure.

10:44.600 --> 10:46.440
So if he comes again,

10:46.520 --> 10:47.920
he will leave a trace.

10:49.440 --> 10:50.960
With Your Ladyship's skills,

10:51.480 --> 10:53.080
even if you can't capture him,

10:53.160 --> 10:54.760
you'll find out who he is.

10:55.920 --> 10:57.400
Mr. Xiao is right.

10:57.480 --> 11:00.200
I'll find someone to complete a portrait
of the perpetrator.

11:00.280 --> 11:01.760
Let me…

11:01.840 --> 11:03.200
It's getting late.

11:03.920 --> 11:05.520
You have work to do tomorrow.

11:05.600 --> 11:07.720
I won't trouble you
with such a trivial matter.

11:08.480 --> 11:09.320
Alright.

11:09.400 --> 11:11.280
I'll leave it to you. I take my leave.

11:23.640 --> 11:26.560
Don't go home these days. Just stay here.

11:27.800 --> 11:29.360
He won't come back tonight.

11:32.480 --> 11:33.320
How do you know?

11:34.040 --> 11:35.520
If you're so good at fortune-telling,

11:35.600 --> 11:37.880
why didn't you foresee
the assassin coming after you?

11:39.520 --> 11:41.760
But I knew you'd come to my rescue.

11:42.920 --> 11:43.920
Still playing tough, huh?

11:46.520 --> 11:47.960
I have my master's compass for protection.

11:48.040 --> 11:49.720
Even if you didn't show up,

11:49.800 --> 11:51.200
I could have saved myself.

11:56.440 --> 11:57.280
Peiyi.

11:59.520 --> 12:00.840
Do you realize

12:01.360 --> 12:03.560
that if your timing was even a bit off,

12:03.640 --> 12:05.480
I would have to collect your corpse?

12:11.400 --> 12:12.480
It's dangerous at night.

12:13.000 --> 12:13.880
Please

12:14.480 --> 12:16.440
take me in for the night.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.200
Go to rest.

12:35.200 --> 12:36.040
Are you mad?

12:45.200 --> 12:46.840
I was careless earlier.

12:46.920 --> 12:49.200
But you've been investigating Silver Mask

12:49.280 --> 12:50.280
and need clues.

12:50.360 --> 12:53.120
If I can lure him out as bait,

12:53.200 --> 12:55.200
perhaps we can turn the tide.

12:58.960 --> 13:00.440
I can hide here for a while,

13:00.960 --> 13:02.680
but not forever.

13:02.760 --> 13:05.480
Even if we don't care about the gossip,

13:06.120 --> 13:08.080
I don't want to give people
more to talk about.

13:13.840 --> 13:14.720
Fine.

13:15.240 --> 13:17.040
Since you insist on being the bait,

13:17.120 --> 13:18.280
go back at dawn.

13:18.360 --> 13:20.960
You and Mr. Gu will protect me, right?

13:22.360 --> 13:24.040
We won't let you die so easily.

13:27.480 --> 13:28.640
Peiyi.

13:29.160 --> 13:32.000
Why did you go
to the Astronomical Bureau tonight?

13:34.400 --> 13:35.360
I brought you

13:36.200 --> 13:37.200
an umbrella.

13:54.400 --> 13:57.480
Centipede. Cinnabar. Illicium anisatum.

13:58.480 --> 13:59.680
Physician Zhao.

13:59.760 --> 14:01.720
I asked you for a prescription.

14:01.800 --> 14:04.200
But you wrote me a deadly poison?

14:05.440 --> 14:07.120
This may look deadly, Your Ladyship.

14:07.200 --> 14:08.360
But the truth is,

14:08.440 --> 14:10.840
with a perfectly controlled dosage,

14:10.920 --> 14:13.520
these toxins can work together

14:13.600 --> 14:14.640
as an antidote.

14:16.040 --> 14:18.160
I just don't want it to be too effective.

14:18.240 --> 14:20.160
If that man gets detoxified with one dose,

14:20.240 --> 14:21.520
how can I use it as bait?

14:23.360 --> 14:24.480
That's easy.

14:24.560 --> 14:25.960
Halve the dosage

14:26.040 --> 14:28.080
and add an extra dose of purslane.

14:28.160 --> 14:30.720
The first dose can already take effect.

14:30.800 --> 14:33.120
But the purslane can cause itchy skin.

14:33.200 --> 14:36.200
He will need me
to apply acupuncture to go on.

14:36.280 --> 14:38.920
Then I can catch the big fish

14:39.440 --> 14:41.280
and bring him to Your Ladyship.

14:45.160 --> 14:46.000
Give me a second.

14:54.320 --> 14:55.520
This is for you.

15:00.000 --> 15:01.200
What is this?

15:02.840 --> 15:04.160
Apply it under your eyes.

15:04.240 --> 15:05.960
Scrub it off after a ke.

15:06.040 --> 15:07.520
It will remove your dark circles

15:07.600 --> 15:10.200
so no one can tell
that you didn't sleep well.

15:10.840 --> 15:14.120
I just developed this paste
for the ladies in the palace.

15:14.200 --> 15:15.720
I haven't even named it yet.

15:17.560 --> 15:18.960
Don't mind its look.

15:19.040 --> 15:20.200
Fight poison with poison.

15:20.280 --> 15:21.720
- Fight dark circles with dark paste.
- Fight dark circles with dark paste.

15:25.480 --> 15:29.040
EASTERN CAPITAL AGARWOOD

15:30.760 --> 15:32.960
Just do what I say
and give out the medicine,

15:33.040 --> 15:35.080
but do not disclose the prescription.

15:39.120 --> 15:41.440
I understand, Your Ladyship.

15:42.280 --> 15:43.480
I owe him big time.

15:43.560 --> 15:46.440
This is all I can do for him.

15:46.520 --> 15:48.280
Be very careful.

15:48.920 --> 15:51.560
This time, I will do you justice.

15:51.640 --> 15:53.440
Thank you for your concern.

16:05.960 --> 16:08.280
You even know about traps?

16:08.800 --> 16:11.760
I read Mojing when I was a child
and tried many tricks on the old man.

16:12.360 --> 16:14.200
I have all these mechanics ready.

16:15.040 --> 16:17.120
Set them up before you leave.

16:17.200 --> 16:19.280
If anything looks moved
when you come back,

16:19.360 --> 16:20.200
just don't come in.

16:21.440 --> 16:23.400
ENTRANCE

16:38.040 --> 16:38.880
With so many traps,

16:38.960 --> 16:41.600
I'll be caught before that assassin.

16:42.920 --> 16:44.440
You have a great memory.

16:45.200 --> 16:46.680
I'm sure you can avoid the traps.

16:47.360 --> 16:48.560
Just be the bait.

16:48.640 --> 16:50.280
Leave the rest to Prosecutor Gu and me.

16:54.280 --> 16:57.000
It seems that you are worried
I might get hurt.

16:58.840 --> 17:00.880
Not at all. I drew it for fun.

17:05.280 --> 17:08.839
You've mapped my residence
in such minute detail

17:08.920 --> 17:10.640
that I have no secrets left before you.

17:11.440 --> 17:13.359
What you are willing to reveal

17:13.440 --> 17:14.319
is not exactly a secret.

17:16.280 --> 17:18.640
I'll be counting on you, Mr. Gu.

17:18.720 --> 17:20.079
Mr. Xiao is putting himself at risk.

17:20.160 --> 17:21.960
We can't make a single mistake.

17:22.040 --> 17:22.880
Rest assured.

17:23.599 --> 17:24.880
If that man dares to come again,

17:24.960 --> 17:27.400
I will bring him to you for interrogation.

17:28.160 --> 17:30.280
You don't necessarily
have to capture him alive.

17:30.920 --> 17:31.760
Understood.

17:32.280 --> 17:34.240
Your Ladyship. I'll check around again.

17:40.320 --> 17:42.360
I know you don't like blades and swords.

17:42.440 --> 17:44.400
I found someone to make this for you.

17:45.200 --> 17:46.040
You can pull the trigger

17:46.720 --> 17:48.720
without much effort to shoot.

17:54.360 --> 17:56.360
Don't find me paranoid.

17:57.240 --> 17:58.280
Why would I?

18:00.040 --> 18:01.920
If Mr. Gu should overlook something,

18:02.960 --> 18:04.080
I'll be counting on this.

18:06.040 --> 18:08.560
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

18:12.120 --> 18:13.040
Your Ladyship.

18:15.960 --> 18:18.240
Someone contacted Jin Niang
about the medicine.

18:18.320 --> 18:20.200
You already found him?

18:20.280 --> 18:21.120
Where are we meeting?

18:21.200 --> 18:22.840
He asked to meet tomorrow,

18:22.920 --> 18:24.600
but the exact time and location

18:24.680 --> 18:26.600
won't be revealed
until an hour before the meeting.

18:28.200 --> 18:29.680
So cautious.

18:29.760 --> 18:31.200
It's probably Silver Mask.

18:31.280 --> 18:33.440
Your Ladyship.
Let me take Physician Zhao's place.

18:33.520 --> 18:35.760
If anything happens, I can handle it.

18:35.840 --> 18:36.960
Absolutely not.

18:37.040 --> 18:38.760
Acupuncture isn't child's play.

18:38.840 --> 18:40.760
If you kill someone,
you'll ruin my reputation.

18:41.400 --> 18:43.280
I'm worried about your life,

18:43.800 --> 18:45.480
but you're worried about your reputation?

18:46.360 --> 18:47.280
I…

18:47.800 --> 18:49.440
I'm also worried about you.

18:49.520 --> 18:51.040
He is so cautious.

18:51.120 --> 18:52.960
If he finds out you're an imposter,

18:53.040 --> 18:54.400
you'd give us away at once.

18:54.480 --> 18:55.920
I know acupoints.

18:56.000 --> 18:58.080
Just teach me how to apply acupuncture.

18:59.480 --> 19:00.760
You underestimate our job.

19:01.360 --> 19:02.880
Applying acupuncture to save lives

19:02.960 --> 19:04.520
is not easier
than practicing martial arts.

19:04.600 --> 19:06.800
You can't do it without practicing
for three or five years.

19:08.200 --> 19:09.560
This person is so cautious.

19:09.640 --> 19:11.680
He will certainly try to test us.

19:11.760 --> 19:13.120
We must be convincing

19:13.200 --> 19:14.560
so that he lets his guard down.

19:14.640 --> 19:16.160
That's how we succeed.

19:17.440 --> 19:19.560
At least let me be
an Apprentice Pharmacist

19:19.640 --> 19:21.680
and go with Physician Zhao.

19:22.200 --> 19:25.280
I fear we'll risk her safety
without even learning his identity.

19:25.360 --> 19:26.360
It's not worth it.

19:26.440 --> 19:27.680
It's difficult.

19:28.960 --> 19:31.360
He may only meet Physician Zhao alone.

19:32.160 --> 19:33.560
Wuren does have a point.

19:34.280 --> 19:35.320
That man is cruel.

19:35.400 --> 19:36.920
Don't take it lightly.

19:37.000 --> 19:39.840
We'll be around to protect Physician Zhao.

19:39.920 --> 19:41.920
He has a scar
on the back of his right hand.

19:42.640 --> 19:43.840
It's just a test this time.

19:43.920 --> 19:45.520
Just remember his appearance

19:45.600 --> 19:47.400
and characteristics this time.

19:48.000 --> 19:49.400
Don't reveal your identity.

19:49.480 --> 19:50.880
Get out as soon as possible.

19:50.960 --> 19:52.440
Don't make any extra moves.

19:53.760 --> 19:55.760
Rest assured. He can't wear his mask

19:55.840 --> 19:57.400
with that eye injury.

19:57.480 --> 19:58.800
I will take a good look at him.

20:02.600 --> 20:03.440
Your Ladyship.

20:03.520 --> 20:05.160
Do you have

20:05.240 --> 20:06.640
any protective gear,

20:07.400 --> 20:09.640
like soft armor for self-defense?

20:09.720 --> 20:12.000
I'm a bit nervous.

20:15.000 --> 20:16.320
PALACE INVESTIGATION BUREAU

20:17.560 --> 20:18.560
Peiyi.

20:21.240 --> 20:23.920
He will suspect that you're luring
him out with the antidote.

20:24.000 --> 20:26.560
So someone will be watching you tomorrow.

20:26.640 --> 20:28.040
I know what to do.

20:28.640 --> 20:30.520
I won't use anyone from the bureau.

20:30.600 --> 20:32.760
Only Wuren and Mr. Gu
will go in plain clothes.

20:32.840 --> 20:35.160
I'll meet them once I lose the tail.

20:35.240 --> 20:38.640
So stay here tomorrow before we return.

20:38.720 --> 20:39.720
Don't go home alone.

20:40.960 --> 20:41.880
I'll go with you.

20:43.120 --> 20:44.920
That will only distract me.

20:45.000 --> 20:46.400
I'm just trying to reassure you.

20:46.920 --> 20:48.480
I'll stay put nearby.

21:00.040 --> 21:00.880
The wind is rising.

21:04.600 --> 21:05.680
Your Ladyship, come with me.

21:18.240 --> 21:20.760
It's a wind-sensing bird
with a flower in its beak.

21:20.840 --> 21:22.520
The spinning flower shows you the wind.

21:22.600 --> 21:23.840
Winter is coming.

21:23.920 --> 21:26.600
Watch the bird to know
if it's getting cold,

21:26.680 --> 21:27.920
so you can dress warmer.

21:28.520 --> 21:29.320
You gave me a crossbow.

21:29.400 --> 21:30.960
Naturally, I have to reciprocate.

21:32.600 --> 21:34.440
I appreciate your kindness, then.

21:50.920 --> 21:52.040
- Come on in.
- Sir, welcome.

21:52.120 --> 21:52.960
YUNCHUI HOUSE

21:53.040 --> 21:54.080
Table for how many?

21:55.000 --> 21:56.560
‪-Sure thing.
‪-Be careful.

21:56.640 --> 21:59.800
- Coming right up.
- Come on in, Sir.

21:59.880 --> 22:00.800
‪Sure.

22:35.440 --> 22:38.040
GET OUT NOW AND GO EAST
SOMEONE WILL MEET YOU

23:05.600 --> 23:06.520
Don't move.

23:07.280 --> 23:08.840
He changed the meeting place

23:08.920 --> 23:10.960
to see if someone
was following Physician Zhao.

23:25.480 --> 23:27.840
YUNCHUI HOUSE

23:40.600 --> 23:42.200
Her Ladyship asked me

23:42.280 --> 23:44.200
to prepare the maps of this entire area.

23:44.280 --> 23:46.080
Except for a few big mansions in the east,

23:46.160 --> 23:47.640
there are many restaurants and taverns.

23:47.720 --> 23:48.920
He is too cautious

23:49.000 --> 23:50.680
to meet Physician Zhao at home just yet.

23:51.280 --> 23:52.360
Restaurants and taverns

23:52.880 --> 23:53.720
aren't private.

23:53.800 --> 23:55.960
Further east is the Jueshui River.

23:56.040 --> 23:57.960
There are plenty of small boats.

23:58.040 --> 24:00.560
It might be private,
but it's impossible for acupuncture.

24:00.640 --> 24:02.080
They wouldn't meet there.

24:02.960 --> 24:03.880
Where can they go?

24:04.480 --> 24:05.640
They can leave by boat.

24:06.160 --> 24:07.320
All those boats look similar.

24:07.400 --> 24:09.720
We can't easily tell them apart.

24:10.240 --> 24:11.240
Here.

24:12.360 --> 24:13.320
Storeroom.

24:14.520 --> 24:15.840
Come with me.

24:24.280 --> 24:26.440
SHUANGHUAN PORT

24:50.040 --> 24:52.640
I can't speak of my difficulties here,
and I apologize

24:53.400 --> 24:54.320
for offending you.

24:55.760 --> 24:57.480
If your reward wasn't so generous,

24:57.560 --> 24:58.640
I'd slap you first.

24:59.440 --> 25:00.680
You are really bold.

25:01.720 --> 25:02.880
Aren't you scared of getting killed?

25:06.080 --> 25:07.440
You're waiting for my help.

25:07.520 --> 25:08.440
You won't kill me.

25:09.120 --> 25:09.960
Take a seat.

25:29.080 --> 25:30.320
What are you doing?

25:32.000 --> 25:33.480
How do I apply acupuncture
with that mask on?

26:19.160 --> 26:21.680
I saw her going to the pier
near Yunchui House and boarded a boat.

26:21.760 --> 26:23.640
I followed her along the riverbank.

26:23.720 --> 26:25.040
Mr. Xiao is right again.

26:26.600 --> 26:29.160
This storeroom is in a secluded spot.
Few people pass by.

26:29.240 --> 26:31.480
Next to the Jueshui River
with alleys all around,

26:31.560 --> 26:34.080
it's surely a nice spot,
flexible and safe.

26:34.800 --> 26:35.640
But Physician Zhao

26:35.720 --> 26:37.680
probably didn't enter by herself.

26:37.760 --> 26:40.440
After Yudi boarded,
several small boats set out at once.

26:40.520 --> 26:41.880
I saw them carrying

26:41.960 --> 26:44.440
over a dozen wooden crates
from the boats into the storeroom.

26:44.520 --> 26:45.360
I didn't see her.

26:45.440 --> 26:46.440
How long has it been?

26:47.320 --> 26:48.160
Less than a ke.

26:56.280 --> 26:58.080
Both of you, stay alert.

26:58.680 --> 27:00.760
These people all look wary,

27:00.840 --> 27:02.800
probably not the storeroom guards.

27:03.600 --> 27:05.280
There is only one exit.

27:05.800 --> 27:07.080
Yudi should still be in there.

27:08.520 --> 27:09.560
Just wait.

27:09.640 --> 27:11.640
If she doesn't come out in a while,

27:11.720 --> 27:12.920
let's go in to save her.

27:20.800 --> 27:21.920
What's your name?

27:24.120 --> 27:24.960
Zhao Sanniang.

27:25.560 --> 27:28.520
Why haven't I heard of you
in the Western Capital

27:28.600 --> 27:30.680
if you are so proficient
in medical skills?

27:31.560 --> 27:32.920
I just came this month.

27:33.000 --> 27:34.480
Who told you to make the antidote?

27:34.560 --> 27:36.040
This is a rare poison.

27:36.120 --> 27:37.680
How do you know about it?

27:37.760 --> 27:39.520
The pharmacy people nearby said

27:39.600 --> 27:41.240
someone was offering
a fortune for an antidote.

27:42.120 --> 27:43.480
It's not easy to live here.

27:43.560 --> 27:44.600
I have the skills.

27:44.680 --> 27:46.200
Of course, I'll try to make money.

27:56.320 --> 27:57.160
What's wrong?

28:00.920 --> 28:02.920
You are really lucky.

28:03.920 --> 28:05.400
It hasn't even been five days.

28:05.480 --> 28:07.120
If you had come to me later,

28:07.200 --> 28:09.320
I'm afraid this eye would be lost.

28:17.360 --> 28:18.600
How does it feel?

28:21.640 --> 28:23.480
It's hurting less now.

28:24.120 --> 28:25.280
Not that itchy, either.

28:28.000 --> 28:28.880
Boss.

28:40.520 --> 28:41.440
Your badge.

28:50.880 --> 28:52.480
- Open it.
- Who are you?

28:54.760 --> 28:55.880
COURT OF JUDICIAL REVIEW BADGE

28:58.920 --> 29:01.400
Someone is smuggling salt
via water transportation.

29:01.480 --> 29:03.280
The Court of Judicial Review
received a tip.

29:03.360 --> 29:04.360
We're here for inspection.

29:08.240 --> 29:09.240
Go ahead.

29:11.440 --> 29:13.080
No matter what's in these crates,

29:13.160 --> 29:15.120
you can't escape the charge
of stealing from your own post.

29:16.200 --> 29:18.640
We only received cloth and silk
in the storeroom today.

29:18.720 --> 29:19.760
There's no smuggled salt.

29:19.840 --> 29:23.000
We have even more reason
to investigate now.

29:27.560 --> 29:29.920
These are all the goods
in the past two days.

29:34.360 --> 29:35.360
What…

29:37.360 --> 29:38.520
No one is allowed to leave

29:39.080 --> 29:40.240
until we are done.

29:40.320 --> 29:42.440
You're alright. This is enough.

29:42.960 --> 29:44.960
Three cents. Leave it in my medicine box.

29:45.040 --> 29:46.240
Please stay.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.760
There's another patient waiting for you.

29:57.880 --> 30:01.040
The one who needs your treatment
is this gentleman.

30:05.000 --> 30:06.680
I may not be a noble person,

30:07.200 --> 30:08.640
but I won't let you toy with me like this.

30:11.680 --> 30:13.200
That man is tall.

30:13.280 --> 30:14.960
He has a scar
on the back of his right hand.

30:15.720 --> 30:16.840
Sanniang, don't be mad.

30:16.920 --> 30:18.320
You saw it too.

30:18.400 --> 30:20.240
This is a serious matter.

30:20.320 --> 30:21.680
I dare not be reckless.

30:21.760 --> 30:24.120
So I had to verify
your medical skills first.

30:24.200 --> 30:25.480
I wasn't toying with you.

30:27.840 --> 30:29.080
You poisoned him

30:29.680 --> 30:31.160
just to test my medical skills?

30:33.440 --> 30:35.000
It's only because

30:35.080 --> 30:37.640
there are too many swindlers out there.

30:38.640 --> 30:40.000
You have exquisite medical skills.

30:40.080 --> 30:42.520
I will pay you handsomely if you cure me.

30:45.160 --> 30:46.480
You are shrewd, ruthless,

30:47.120 --> 30:48.120
and no ordinary person.

30:48.640 --> 30:49.480
How do I address you?

30:49.560 --> 30:52.200
I rank third in my family just like you.

30:52.280 --> 30:53.320
Just call me Third Master.

30:54.400 --> 30:56.520
Third Master. Please.

31:09.280 --> 31:11.000
My eye

31:11.600 --> 31:12.920
is destroyed.

31:16.280 --> 31:18.040
The poison has reached the flesh.

31:18.120 --> 31:20.160
If left untreated,
it will get to the bones

31:20.880 --> 31:23.040
and kill you with unbearable headaches.

31:25.000 --> 31:26.400
I'm counting on you.

32:07.800 --> 32:09.560
They dare let us check these crates.

32:10.120 --> 32:12.520
It means Yudi is not in there.

32:44.320 --> 32:46.520
The meridian and collateral needling
you performed

32:47.200 --> 32:49.160
were authentic Nine Needling Methods.

32:49.760 --> 32:50.720
Sanniang.

32:50.800 --> 32:52.800
You're not a traveling physician.

32:54.480 --> 32:57.200
I did perform
the authentic Nine Needling Methods.

32:57.280 --> 32:58.840
But that evolved from

32:58.920 --> 33:00.800
the folk practice,
"Turtle Diagram Eight Techniques."

33:00.880 --> 33:04.200
Third Master, don't start showing off
just because I'm good-looking.

33:21.000 --> 33:22.480
These are for the palace.

33:22.560 --> 33:23.880
Show me a warranty

33:24.400 --> 33:25.320
before you touch them.

33:26.240 --> 33:27.120
Behave.

33:33.120 --> 33:34.600
Don't push your luck.

34:21.199 --> 34:23.120
Herbal smell. It's here.

34:26.920 --> 34:28.520
One acupuncture session

34:28.600 --> 34:30.440
can't fully remove the poison.

34:31.120 --> 34:33.000
Steam your eye for a ke
in the morning and evening respectively.

34:33.080 --> 34:35.360
Three days later, we will do this again.

34:35.440 --> 34:39.400
In your opinion,
how long will it take to heal?

34:43.719 --> 34:44.920
At least a month.

34:45.000 --> 34:47.679
But next time, I won't be here again.

34:48.199 --> 34:49.159
You have a toxin in your system.

34:49.239 --> 34:52.360
Moving around makes it spread faster.

34:52.440 --> 34:54.360
I can go to your mansion.

34:57.680 --> 35:00.400
No need. Just follow me now.

35:08.320 --> 35:09.160
What are you doing?

35:09.240 --> 35:10.600
Let me go.

35:10.680 --> 35:12.160
Let go.

35:13.680 --> 35:14.640
Let go.

35:18.240 --> 35:19.120
Why are you scared?

35:19.720 --> 35:22.880
Isn't it your job
as a physician to save lives?

35:22.960 --> 35:26.240
You are a traveling physician
who doesn't reside in one place.

35:26.320 --> 35:28.800
Follow me home,
and I will provide for you.

35:28.880 --> 35:30.080
Unless you're scared

35:30.160 --> 35:32.240
the Imperial Medical Office
won't be able to find you.

35:34.360 --> 35:36.440
Afraid that Li Peiyi
won't be able to find you?

35:53.960 --> 35:55.000
Let her go.

36:04.800 --> 36:06.560
I knew it was you behind this.

36:10.520 --> 36:13.640
Which old acquaintance are you?

36:16.200 --> 36:17.720
You owe my master your life.

36:18.240 --> 36:19.480
I need to find you to make you pay.

36:19.560 --> 36:23.480
Did Du Zhixing only teach you
to talk tough all these years?

36:24.880 --> 36:26.720
I'm afraid you don't know
what I'm capable of.

36:29.560 --> 36:32.840
Last time, that old man died for you.

36:32.920 --> 36:34.280
This time,

36:34.360 --> 36:36.120
you won't be able to escape.

36:36.880 --> 36:38.440
I finally tracked you down.

36:38.520 --> 36:39.560
Why would I rush to leave?

36:39.640 --> 36:42.080
I wanted to have a serious talk with you.

36:42.160 --> 36:43.560
I'm a difficult person.

36:43.640 --> 36:45.640
If you don't make things clear,

36:45.720 --> 36:46.560
I won't leave.

36:47.680 --> 36:49.840
This is my territory.

36:49.920 --> 36:50.960
It's not up to you.

36:54.600 --> 36:55.440
We don't know

36:56.040 --> 36:57.440
who will die first.

37:05.920 --> 37:08.240
You evil woman! What did you do?

37:08.320 --> 37:09.360
I…

37:09.440 --> 37:11.200
I administered acupuncture.
I didn't do anything.

37:13.760 --> 37:14.920
Physician Zhao has medical ethics.

37:15.000 --> 37:17.280
She knows that you deserve to die,

37:17.360 --> 37:18.600
but still does her best to cure you.

37:18.680 --> 37:21.840
What a pity. Medical ethics is something

37:21.920 --> 37:22.760
I don't have.

37:24.800 --> 37:28.320
I knew you were cautious enough
to test her in advance.

37:28.400 --> 37:30.040
So except for this first row of needles,

37:30.120 --> 37:33.080
I've poisoned all the other needles.

37:34.000 --> 37:36.000
- You…
- Your Ladyship.

37:36.080 --> 37:38.120
How can you meddle
with my acupuncture kit?

37:38.200 --> 37:39.960
You're ruining my reputation.

37:41.320 --> 37:42.840
A villain like me administered the poison.

37:43.560 --> 37:45.000
You're practically his savior

37:45.080 --> 37:46.520
if you can help him detoxify.

37:46.600 --> 37:48.120
Don't you agree?

37:50.200 --> 37:51.320
Give me the antidote.

37:52.280 --> 37:53.200
This is

37:53.280 --> 37:56.080
Physician Zhao,
the top expert in detoxification.

37:56.160 --> 37:57.080
She's here.

37:57.160 --> 37:58.360
So I didn't bring the antidote.

37:59.400 --> 38:00.240
You…

38:01.680 --> 38:02.960
You…

38:06.640 --> 38:07.720
You should remain calm.

38:07.800 --> 38:08.640
I know you're in pain.

38:08.720 --> 38:11.000
B-But don't get worked up. Let me see.

38:12.280 --> 38:13.120
Li Peiyi.

38:13.200 --> 38:15.880
Tell her what poison you used.

38:15.960 --> 38:17.600
No, no. Don't give me tips.

38:18.760 --> 38:19.880
Let me insert the needles now.

38:19.960 --> 38:21.200
Aren't the needles poisonous?

38:21.280 --> 38:24.160
I took the first row ones.
They're safe. Stop talking.

38:24.240 --> 38:25.360
Or I can't save you anymore.

38:25.440 --> 38:27.120
Sit down.

38:50.880 --> 38:53.400
I can't detoxify you yet,
but I can relieve your pain.

38:53.480 --> 38:55.000
You won't die.

38:56.040 --> 38:57.960
Just answer Her Ladyship's questions.

38:58.040 --> 38:59.720
I'll come up with a prescription tonight.

38:59.800 --> 39:02.560
But I'll bring it to you once you go back

39:02.640 --> 39:03.480
with Her Ladyship.

39:04.280 --> 39:05.200
Lunatic.

39:05.800 --> 39:07.880
Both of you. You're crazy.

39:07.960 --> 39:10.080
Wuren, Mr. Xiao,
please take Physician Zhao

39:10.160 --> 39:11.320
back to the palace.

39:13.200 --> 39:14.160
Get up.

39:24.120 --> 39:26.160
Confess. Who are you?

39:31.280 --> 39:34.320
Callused hands with deformed knuckles.

39:34.400 --> 39:35.640
Signs of martial arts training.

39:35.720 --> 39:37.800
You are a military man
with an official title.

39:37.880 --> 39:38.760
That's for sure.

39:39.360 --> 39:43.040
Even if I don't remember the names
of every military official,

39:43.120 --> 39:44.360
I've seen most of them.

39:44.440 --> 39:45.760
But I've never seen you.

39:46.360 --> 39:47.960
You are a stationed officer?

39:56.320 --> 39:58.360
I've seen men
who have campaigned for years,

39:58.440 --> 40:00.880
sleeping rough in the grass,
buried in snow,

40:00.960 --> 40:03.400
their wrists and shoulders
scarred by armor.

40:03.480 --> 40:04.520
But nothing on you.

40:05.120 --> 40:06.960
So the Protectorate you serve

40:07.040 --> 40:09.320
must have known peace
for at least five years.

40:10.000 --> 40:10.920
That means…

40:11.800 --> 40:12.640
Andong Protectorate.

40:17.560 --> 40:19.960
Military officials can't return
unless they are called.

40:20.040 --> 40:23.160
You've been in the Western Capital
for quite a while

40:23.240 --> 40:24.680
but haven't seen His Majesty.

40:25.280 --> 40:26.560
You must have come
with the Protector-General

40:26.640 --> 40:27.520
to deliver his official report.

40:27.600 --> 40:28.760
But given your rank,

40:28.840 --> 40:31.240
you weren't allowed to see His Majesty.

40:31.320 --> 40:34.080
I'll leave it at that.

40:34.160 --> 40:36.240
It's easy, even if you don't confess.

40:36.320 --> 40:39.200
I'll cut off your head and show it around.

40:39.280 --> 40:40.480
Someone will recognize you.

40:40.560 --> 40:41.160
‪LV CHONGSHAN,
‪GENERAL OF THE ANDONG PROTECTORATE

40:41.240 --> 40:43.000
At this point,

40:43.520 --> 40:45.040
there's no point in hiding anything.

40:46.560 --> 40:49.520
I'm Lv Chongshan.
General of the Andong Protectorate.

40:51.000 --> 40:52.240
Lv Chongshan.

40:56.240 --> 40:58.240
Even if I ask you who sent you to kill me,

40:58.320 --> 40:59.840
I bet you won't tell me.

41:00.520 --> 41:03.040
I thought you were just a pawn.

41:03.120 --> 41:04.160
Now it seems

41:04.760 --> 41:06.280
that you were involved in that massacre

41:06.880 --> 41:07.800
15 years ago.

41:09.080 --> 41:10.440
Didn't you lose your memory?

41:11.040 --> 41:13.880
Why don't you live an easy life in peace?

41:13.960 --> 41:16.480
Why bother sneaking around
and looking into what happened back then?

41:17.080 --> 41:18.920
That's typical of women.

41:19.000 --> 41:20.880
When things get real, you lose your head.

41:24.160 --> 41:25.400
I'm a woman, so what?

41:25.920 --> 41:27.480
I will be able to take revenge.

41:28.120 --> 41:29.000
Take revenge?

41:29.680 --> 41:31.280
We don't let you look into it

41:31.360 --> 41:34.400
to protect the reputation of your parents.

41:34.480 --> 41:36.480
So what if you kill me?

41:36.560 --> 41:38.640
You're just a petty general.

41:38.720 --> 41:39.880
They will abandon you

41:40.400 --> 41:42.480
when necessary,
no matter how capable you are.

41:43.480 --> 41:45.200
Tell me everything you know.

41:45.280 --> 41:46.400
Maybe I can save you.

41:49.480 --> 41:51.360
I don't need you to save me.

41:51.960 --> 41:54.400
I'm afraid you think
too highly of yourself.

41:54.480 --> 41:56.560
His Majesty does adore you.

41:56.640 --> 41:59.000
But if you bring up that scandal,

41:59.080 --> 42:00.520
he won't tolerate you.

42:04.200 --> 42:06.640
In the end, you people

42:06.720 --> 42:08.600
only care about ranks and wages,

42:08.680 --> 42:11.240
life and death, and His Majesty's favor.

42:11.760 --> 42:13.000
But I don't care at all.

42:14.520 --> 42:15.760
But you

42:16.480 --> 42:19.560
seem rather terrified that your master
will abandon you.

42:20.360 --> 42:21.200
You should be.

42:21.280 --> 42:24.200
After all, he let you roam around
and seek treatment

42:24.280 --> 42:25.480
all by yourself.

42:27.120 --> 42:28.840
The Prince of Duan
colluded with foreign powers

42:28.920 --> 42:30.120
and plotted rebellion in secret.

42:30.200 --> 42:32.600
He thought highly of himself
and defied His Majesty.

42:35.200 --> 42:36.520
Should I go on?

42:38.000 --> 42:41.320
You worked so hard
to fabricate this story.

42:41.400 --> 42:42.640
Can you leave it unfinished?

42:45.920 --> 42:47.360
At the end of that year,

42:47.440 --> 42:48.560
Prince of Duan returned

42:49.160 --> 42:52.080
and secretly brought a branch
of the Jianning Iron Army

42:52.160 --> 42:54.920
to station in the Western Capital.

42:56.080 --> 42:59.120
Everyone said that he was planning
to rebel on the Lantern Festival.

42:59.200 --> 43:01.560
His Majesty naturally heard about it.

43:02.160 --> 43:04.600
But considering the Prince of Duan's
military achievements,

43:04.680 --> 43:07.120
His Majesty still summoned him
at the Hai hour that night.

43:07.960 --> 43:10.160
But the Prince of Duan defied His Majesty

43:10.680 --> 43:13.080
and refused to enter
the palace out of arrogance.

43:13.960 --> 43:16.560
That day, Father and I
were celebrating at home.

43:17.080 --> 43:19.120
He never mentioned
any decree from His Majesty.

43:19.200 --> 43:20.920
He was plotting a rebellion.

43:21.000 --> 43:23.400
Of course, he wouldn't care about
the imperial decrees.

43:30.360 --> 43:32.480
Your stories are full of loopholes

43:32.560 --> 43:33.840
and make no sense.

43:34.720 --> 43:36.240
If he was plotting a rebellion,

43:36.320 --> 43:38.680
why did he lose it and kill everyone?

43:39.720 --> 43:41.160
That night,

43:41.240 --> 43:43.440
over a dozen armed Jianning troops

43:43.520 --> 43:45.200
were arrested in the Western Capital.

43:45.280 --> 43:47.920
As the Left General
of the Imperial Guards,

43:48.000 --> 43:50.760
I went to invite the Prince of Duan
by His Majesty's decree.

43:50.840 --> 43:53.440
Knowing that his plan was exposed,
he was cornered

43:53.520 --> 43:54.920
and intended to fight us.

43:55.000 --> 43:56.640
Princess Consort of Duan
tried to reason with him.

43:56.720 --> 43:58.360
But he suddenly lost it

43:58.440 --> 44:00.880
and killed everyone in the mansion,

44:02.040 --> 44:04.240
including Princess Consort of Duan.

44:05.200 --> 44:07.040
I narrowly escaped

44:07.120 --> 44:09.720
with serious injury
and reported it to His Majesty.

44:09.800 --> 44:12.040
To preserve the dignity of Prince of Duan,

44:12.120 --> 44:14.720
His Majesty never mentioned
the potential rebellion.

44:22.480 --> 44:24.560
The illustrious Jianning Iron Army

44:25.160 --> 44:28.880
was quietly dismissed after the incident.

44:28.960 --> 44:31.960
The leading generals
disappeared into thin air.

44:32.720 --> 44:34.640
Has Your Ladyship truly

44:34.720 --> 44:37.320
never wondered what lies behind all this?
